<title>UK: FCCBO sets $800 million 12-year FRN.</title>
<headline>FCCBO sets $800 million 12-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Goldman Sachs International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FCCBO LTD AND FCCBO CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $800 MLN	BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY	.MAY.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     **	  PAY DATE    29.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA2	 ISS PRICE  **	  FULL FEES   50 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA	  REOFFER    **</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED AROUND 38-40 BP OVER LIBOR</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    GOV LAW     N.Y</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> NOTES	CALLABLE FROM MAY.00 AT PAR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
